flowchart TD
  I[ผู้ใช้ตั้งค่าทริป] --> S[TripPlanner state]
  S -->|POST /api/routes| RH[Next.js route handler]
  RH -->|Routes API| G[Google Routes]
  G -->|distance, legs, polyline| RH
  RH --> S
  S -->|polyline / type filters| PH[POST /api/places]
  PH -->|Places API| P[Google Places]
  P --> PH --> S
  S -->|vehicle settings + legs| BAT[Battery estimate]
  BAT --> VIEW[Map / itinerary / charger list]
  S -->|save local| LS[(Browser storage)]
  S -->|login + Cloud Sync| AUTH[Auth0 session]
  AUTH --> CR[/api/cloud-routes/]
  CR --> REDIS[(Redis scoped by Auth0 sub)]
